unit keys. Also, for each space unit with a key greater than 100000, show the space unit code, organization name, HR department name (for the space unit), and the sum of space unit keys within each warehouse load date group. Indicate the source of each row as either \"TopProvostDepartment\" or \"SpaceUnit\". The columns should be: department code, department name, school area name, department rank within school area, space unit count (for department), sum of space unit keys (for department), space unit code, organization name, HR department name (for space unit), sum of space unit keys within warehouse load date, and source. Do not return any rounded answers."
